## Platform Limits
Record quotas, execution limits, connection limits, payload limits, or other platform constraints with source/currentness where material.

## Measurement Points
List client, server, persistence, external-service, queue, cache, and end-to-end instrumentation points.

## Performance Invariants
Examples: no N+1 access, bounded retries, batch remote calls, tenant-safe cache keys, no unbounded client fan-out.

## Baseline Evidence
Record actual measurements rather than assumptions when available.

## Known Bottlenecks / Unknowns
Do not optimize unknown bottlenecks before measurement.
